WEBVTT

00:01.380 --> 00:03.000
I did it...

00:03.710 --> 00:05.290
It's finally done!

00:05.290 --> 00:08.380
This is a masterpiece that
transcends "Strawberry Milk"!

00:09.580 --> 00:11.920
Wow, it's late.

00:11.920 --> 00:13.250
Bed time.

00:18.290 --> 00:21.630
You've worked so hard today, Lady Komari,
I decided to warm it up for you...

00:22.080 --> 00:23.790
with my bare skin.

00:24.670 --> 00:26.170
Why you...

00:26.170 --> 00:27.670
You degenerate maid!

00:27.670 --> 00:30.790
I'm totally gonna report you
to my dad, just you wait!

00:45.130 --> 00:51.540
<b>Sakuna Memoir and the Seven Crimson Lords</b>

00:46.830 --> 00:48.710
Hmph. Stupid Empress.

00:49.130 --> 00:51.790
Calling for me out of the nowhere is so rude.

00:51.790 --> 00:55.170
That manner of being so brutally honest
in regards to that terrible tyrant...

00:55.170 --> 00:56.750
You are fearless, My Excellency!

00:56.750 --> 00:58.630
Y-yeah, sure.

00:58.630 --> 01:00.130
But Caostel...

01:00.420 --> 01:02.630
Why are you here?

01:02.630 --> 01:06.630
Oh! Actually, there's something
I want to give to you.

01:07.500 --> 01:11.330
It's the first round of your merch,
Your Excellency's t-shirt.

01:11.330 --> 01:14.290
We still hadn't extended an offering
to Your Excellency yourself.

01:14.290 --> 01:14.920
What?

01:18.040 --> 01:19.000
What?

01:19.000 --> 01:20.580
Isn't it exquisite?

01:20.580 --> 01:22.960
It's been selling like hotcakes!

01:22.960 --> 01:24.210
Whaaaat?!

01:24.210 --> 01:25.630
Please try it on, Your Excellency.

01:25.630 --> 01:27.420
I can't, that's weird!

01:27.420 --> 01:29.000
There'd be double of the same face!

01:29.000 --> 01:30.670
That means double the loveliness.

01:30.670 --> 01:32.710
You idiot! I wouldn't even put this on

01:32.710 --> 01:35.170
if I got soaked by rain and
had nothing else to wear!

01:35.170 --> 01:37.080
Hey, Vill, say something!

01:37.080 --> 01:38.750
I bought a hundred of them.

01:38.750 --> 01:40.710
Quit wasting your paychecks!

01:42.420 --> 01:46.830
Oh my, Commander Terakomari
Gandesblood, isn't it?

01:47.750 --> 01:50.080
I hear you're on a winning streak.

01:50.380 --> 01:53.460
There's just no stopping
the 7th Unit, is there?

01:53.460 --> 01:54.210
Huh?

01:54.210 --> 01:56.790
But you're only going for the small fry.

01:57.130 --> 01:59.420
You only sit and give
the appropriate commands

01:59.420 --> 02:02.170
from your safe place
in the midst of battle.

02:03.540 --> 02:05.130
You're...

02:05.750 --> 02:07.880
actually weak, aren't you?

02:13.500 --> 02:16.580
My apologies for not asking before,
but who are you?

02:18.330 --> 02:21.920
Who am I? How dare you ask me that!

02:21.920 --> 02:23.790
Sorry. May I have your name please?

02:23.790 --> 02:26.040
How you asked is not the problem here!

02:26.250 --> 02:29.630
Do you not know that I happen to be
the wise and great Crimson Lord,

02:29.630 --> 02:32.330
"The Black Flash" Flöte Mascarail?!

02:32.920 --> 02:34.790
How impressive, Lady Komari!

02:34.790 --> 02:37.670
Your style has the most prominent of
the Seven Crimson Lords of the empire

02:37.670 --> 02:39.670
proactively starting a fight with you!

02:39.670 --> 02:41.040
I kind of like it!

02:41.040 --> 02:43.080
You should've told me
if you knew who she was!

02:43.080 --> 02:44.960
She's a member of
the Seven Crimson Lords?!

02:46.830 --> 02:49.670
Well, I'm being made fun of too.

02:49.670 --> 02:51.460
I-I didn't mean it that way...

02:51.460 --> 02:52.540
Lady Mascarail.

02:52.540 --> 02:54.500
I am terribly sorry.

02:54.500 --> 02:56.000
Here you go.

02:56.000 --> 02:57.540
Please accept this as an apology.

02:57.540 --> 02:59.630
Oh, bloody buns.

02:59.630 --> 03:01.080
How thoughtful of you.

03:01.580 --> 03:03.290
What is this?

03:03.290 --> 03:05.380
Lady Komari is the strongest.

03:05.380 --> 03:07.250
And she's also the cutest in the world.

03:07.500 --> 03:10.330
Once can infer that since you have made

03:10.330 --> 03:13.290
a low-level provocation against
Lady Komari just moments ago,

03:13.290 --> 03:17.880
that you, Lady Mascarail,
don't quite understand how that works.

03:18.790 --> 03:20.420
That's enough, shut up! Please shut up!

03:20.420 --> 03:21.290
I understand completely, Miss Gandesblood.
That's enough, shut up! Please shut up!<b></b>

03:21.290 --> 03:23.830
I understand completely, Miss Gandesblood.

03:23.960 --> 03:27.210
It seems as if you and I won't be
getting along, then.

03:29.420 --> 03:31.210
Th-that isn't true...

03:31.210 --> 03:33.420
If we just deepen our friendship starting now...

03:33.420 --> 03:37.130
Impossible as long as you still have
that unpleasant attitude.

03:37.130 --> 03:38.290
Goodness.

03:38.420 --> 03:41.000
If you're so full of yourself just because
you're Lady Karen's favorite,

03:41.000 --> 03:42.420
you'll get yourself hurt.

03:42.420 --> 03:43.500
Lady Karen?

03:43.500 --> 03:44.750
And who is that?

03:44.750 --> 03:46.460
Don't play dumb!

03:46.460 --> 03:49.920
How could you not know
Her Majesty the Empress' first name!

03:49.920 --> 03:52.500
I had no idea the empress had
such a cute name...

03:52.500 --> 03:54.540
Ugh, deplorable!

03:54.540 --> 03:56.880
Lady Karen's not right in the head either.

03:56.880 --> 03:59.330
I can't believe that she would
favor a vampire like you

03:59.330 --> 04:00.920
whose only strong point is your lineage!

04:00.920 --> 04:04.000
And she won't even give me
the slightest hint of attention!

04:04.000 --> 04:05.750
What are you talking about?

04:05.750 --> 04:09.170
And with the whole Sakuna Memoir thing,
she is too unserious!

04:09.170 --> 04:12.790
In any case!
I refuse to acknowledge you.

04:12.790 --> 04:14.210
If you have a problem with that,

04:14.210 --> 04:17.630
show to me military might that is worthy of
being one of the Seven Crimson Lords.

04:17.630 --> 04:19.670
I-I'll show you just that someday.

04:19.670 --> 04:20.960
But today's not that day.

04:20.960 --> 04:25.750
Hmph. You'll lose your life
putting off things like that.

04:26.000 --> 04:27.330
She's got a point there!

04:27.330 --> 04:29.380
Though I don't quite know
what she means...

04:29.790 --> 04:32.710
Goodbye, Miss Gandesblood.

04:33.170 --> 04:38.000
When we next meet, I would love the honor
of seeing what you're truly capable of.

04:52.710 --> 04:54.580
You made it, Komari!

04:54.580 --> 04:56.040
It was hot outside, wasn't it?

04:56.040 --> 04:57.750
Have an ice cream to cool off!

04:59.080 --> 05:02.250
It's mandarin-flavored, yummy!

05:02.250 --> 05:03.710
I'm not here for that!

05:03.710 --> 05:05.710
Your Majesty, tell me about
that important matter now.

05:07.080 --> 05:08.460
My, aren't we impatient!

05:08.920 --> 05:11.790
By the way, how did that
involuntary indirect kiss taste?

05:11.790 --> 05:14.750
Stop saying gross things!
It tasted like a mandarin, duh!

05:14.750 --> 05:16.670
Nice! So sweet and tart!

05:17.130 --> 05:21.540
By the way, it seems last night
your father was killed by someone.

05:21.540 --> 05:23.080
More importantly, what was that urgent ma-

05:23.080 --> 05:24.710
What?!

05:24.710 --> 05:26.130
Don't be alarmed,

05:26.130 --> 05:28.920
he should be revived at some point today
by the power of the Dark Core.

05:28.920 --> 05:31.330
I-I know that, but still...

05:31.790 --> 05:34.630
He was murdered on his way home
from yesterday's Imperial Council.

05:34.630 --> 05:36.630
Someone punched through
his stomach barehanded.

05:37.460 --> 05:39.500
Armand isn't the only issue here, though.

05:39.500 --> 05:43.580
Five high-level officials were killed
in about a week.

05:43.880 --> 05:46.420
What's more, amongst the slain
was a Crimson Lord.

05:47.130 --> 05:49.290
This is terrorism.

05:49.290 --> 05:53.460
All of those killed were unaware
that they were killed.

05:53.880 --> 05:56.710
So naturally, they don't remember
the face of the murderer.

05:56.710 --> 05:59.920
Do you mean there was memory
manipulation magic utilized?

06:00.330 --> 06:02.000
That is a possiblity.

06:02.460 --> 06:05.960
Upon reflection, I think this is
not magic, but Core Implosion.

06:05.960 --> 06:07.880
Core Implosion...

06:07.880 --> 06:09.580
This is quite an ordeal.

06:09.580 --> 06:10.630
Indeed.

06:10.630 --> 06:13.040
I have a bad feeling about this...

06:13.040 --> 06:15.580
Also, resolving an issue like this

06:15.580 --> 06:18.670
has long been the role of
the Seven Crimson Lords.

06:18.670 --> 06:19.710
Komari.

06:19.710 --> 06:20.670
What?

06:20.670 --> 06:22.540
I'd like you to confront the terrorist.

06:22.540 --> 06:24.540
Nope! Don't wanna,
don't wanna, don't wanna!

06:24.540 --> 06:26.170
Lady Komari, please calm down.
Don't wanna, don't wanna, don't wanna!<b></b>

06:26.170 --> 06:27.290
Shuddup shuddup!

06:27.290 --> 06:29.830
I've been working for forever!
I'm sick of this!

06:29.830 --> 06:32.330
This is what is expected of
the Seven Crimson Lords.

06:32.330 --> 06:34.000
So it's fine to make me work
with no days off

06:34.000 --> 06:35.580
because I'm one of the
Seven Crimson Lords?

06:35.580 --> 06:37.330
This is what is expected of
the Seven Crimson Lords.

06:37.330 --> 06:39.080
I'm done with this! I want time off!

06:39.080 --> 06:40.210
Then take some time off.
I'm done with this! I want time off!<b></b>

06:40.210 --> 06:40.880
Then take some time off.

06:41.420 --> 06:42.790
Wh-what do you mean?

06:42.790 --> 06:45.630
I do feel a little sorry for you.

06:45.630 --> 06:47.750
If you can apprehend the terrorist,

06:47.750 --> 06:49.750
I will give you an entire week of vacation.

06:50.710 --> 06:54.460
But there's no way I can capture a terrorist.

06:54.460 --> 06:56.040
Not to worry.

06:56.040 --> 06:59.210
This time you won't be
undertaking this duty alone.

06:59.210 --> 07:02.130
Sakuna Memoir! There's no need to be shy!

07:19.540 --> 07:20.540
Beautiful.

07:20.540 --> 07:21.210
Huh?

07:21.210 --> 07:23.460
I-I'm sorry. I just...

07:23.460 --> 07:26.250
No, you don't really need to
apologize for that,

07:26.250 --> 07:29.790
I mean, beauty like mine only comes around
every hundred million years and all...

07:32.080 --> 07:36.170
This terrorist is a master at murdering
even the Seven Crimson Lords.

07:36.170 --> 07:39.750
Therefore, you two will work together
and carry out this mission together.

07:40.210 --> 07:43.080
Your Majesty, I'm not really one to talk, but...

07:43.080 --> 07:44.170
there's no way this girl can...

07:44.170 --> 07:45.330
No need to worry.
there's no way this girl can...<b></b>

07:45.330 --> 07:46.330
No need to worry.

07:46.330 --> 07:49.290
That girl has a strong desire to
exact revenge on the terrorist

07:49.290 --> 07:50.710
by any means necessary.

07:50.710 --> 07:51.920
Revenge?

07:52.880 --> 07:53.880
Sakuna.

07:55.330 --> 07:58.920
Sakuna Memoir. I'm a Crimson Lord.

07:58.920 --> 08:00.420
Even though I'm one of the seven,

08:00.420 --> 08:02.830
I'm the only one who was
killed by a terrorist...

08:02.830 --> 08:05.670
so I must redeem myself.

08:05.670 --> 08:09.170
A Crimson Lord?! THAT girl?!

08:10.130 --> 08:13.170
Th-this is embarrassing,
so please read it later.

08:13.170 --> 08:15.080
I'm going to leave now, goodbye!

08:15.080 --> 08:16.380
Huh, wait!

08:16.790 --> 08:21.880
Er, uh... this might look suspicious
to someone else...

08:32.290 --> 08:34.920
To Lady Terakomari Gandesblood:

08:34.920 --> 08:38.830
I'm sorry for giving you
this letter so suddenly.

08:38.830 --> 08:43.290
But I had no confidence in being able
to say what I want to well enough,

08:43.290 --> 08:46.250
so I had no choice but to
write it out like this.

08:47.000 --> 08:50.670
My name is Sakuna Memoir.

08:50.670 --> 08:52.580
My hobby is reading.

08:52.580 --> 08:55.920
I'd like it if you just called me "Sakuna."

08:56.380 --> 09:00.750
I killed one of the Seven Crimson Lords
in an accident by chance,

09:00.750 --> 09:03.330
they took it as me revolting

09:03.330 --> 09:06.040
and I took over the position.

09:06.750 --> 09:10.670
I don't think I'm a good fit for
something like a Crimson Lord,

09:10.670 --> 09:13.290
but I can't quit even if I want to.

09:13.290 --> 09:17.080
As you know, if you choose
to quit the Crimson Lords,

09:17.080 --> 09:19.750
you will suffer death by explosion.

09:20.250 --> 09:22.750
As someone who was killed by a terrorist,

09:22.750 --> 09:24.830
I brought disgrace upon
the honor of the empire.

09:25.540 --> 09:28.580
With the way things are going, the fate of
being blown up draws ever closer.

09:29.330 --> 09:33.130
That's why I have to capture the terrorist.

09:33.670 --> 09:36.380
Those are my circumstances.

09:36.380 --> 09:38.670
This probably isn't something I should say

09:38.670 --> 09:42.250
to someone as strong and impressive
as you, Miss Terakomari,

09:42.250 --> 09:47.580
but I felt like I had to tell you all of this.

09:47.580 --> 09:51.040
That's why I had to make these
weak complaints to you.

09:51.040 --> 09:54.960
The Crimson Lords are far superior to me
and I'm not much good at anything,

09:54.960 --> 09:56.880
but please treat me well.

09:56.880 --> 09:58.830
I will work hard,
with every fiber of my being.

09:59.960 --> 10:01.710
What is her deal?

10:01.710 --> 10:03.080
She is way too cute!

10:03.290 --> 10:06.170
Is that kind of girl your type,
Lady Komari?

10:06.170 --> 10:07.290
My type?

10:07.290 --> 10:09.000
Yeah. I guess I like her.

10:11.000 --> 10:13.540
All right! I'm gonna go find Sakuna.

10:13.540 --> 10:14.460
Zoom!

10:14.460 --> 10:16.420
If you're going to meet with Lady Memoir,

10:16.420 --> 10:20.540
you must have a serious meeting
about catching the terrorist.

10:21.630 --> 10:26.080
But you know, thinking about it,
it's really not something I can do, right?

10:26.080 --> 10:29.630
I mean, I'm going after a violent terrorist
who's killed a lot of people.

10:29.630 --> 10:32.380
In that case, it's a good idea to make
good use of your subordinates.

10:32.380 --> 10:36.420
You have 500 brutal subordinates
at your call, don't you?

10:36.420 --> 10:37.670
Yeah, but...

10:42.580 --> 10:44.500
Well, they seem busy.

10:44.500 --> 10:46.000
It's all right.

10:46.000 --> 10:47.830
Now then, they're awaiting your order.

10:49.250 --> 10:51.460
Troops! May I have a moment?

10:52.710 --> 10:56.040
You will now receive instruction
from Lady Komari.

10:56.040 --> 10:57.630
Clear out your ears!

10:57.630 --> 10:58.920
Don't miss a single word!

10:58.920 --> 11:00.380
Who do we gotta kill?!

11:00.380 --> 11:01.420
Your Excellency.

11:01.420 --> 11:04.250
Is this about the serial murders
mentioned before?

11:04.250 --> 11:05.250
Y-yeah.

11:05.380 --> 11:08.290
To tell the truth, there was an
imperial order from the empress.

11:08.290 --> 11:12.830
I understand she wants me to capture
the terrorist who did it.

11:12.830 --> 11:14.920
Whoa!

11:15.460 --> 11:18.710
I'm very sorry to trouble you all with a
request like this while you're so busy,

11:18.710 --> 11:20.960
but I want you all to help me.

11:20.960 --> 11:22.000
Yeah!

11:22.000 --> 11:24.250
Stop that!
You're disturbing the neighbors!

11:24.250 --> 11:29.630
Your Excellency, would you consider giving
a reward to whoever captures the criminal?

11:29.630 --> 11:31.960
It will boost the men's morale
a hundred fold.

11:31.960 --> 11:33.670
Reward, huh...

11:33.670 --> 11:35.130
Hmm...

11:35.580 --> 11:36.790
I know!

11:36.790 --> 11:41.210
The one who catches the terrorist
will get a special 3-day vacation!

11:44.750 --> 11:45.750
Huh?

11:45.750 --> 11:46.880
Your Excellency.

11:47.420 --> 11:51.000
Unfortunately, I don't think
that's a reward.

11:51.000 --> 11:52.330
Eh? Why not?

11:52.330 --> 11:54.670
Their hobby is murdering people.

11:54.670 --> 11:56.500
Even if they are given a vacation,

11:56.500 --> 11:59.880
they won't be able to go wild on the
battlefield so they'd be rather discontent.

11:59.880 --> 12:01.250
Have a look.

12:01.750 --> 12:04.790
Their expressions are all steadily
turning to despair.

12:05.580 --> 12:07.670
Oh crap, I'm gonna be overthrown!

12:07.670 --> 12:11.380
B-but this isn't any old vacation, you know!
Er, it's like this!

12:11.380 --> 12:15.670
Along with the vacation,
I'll present to you a ticket to go to the zoo!

12:17.040 --> 12:21.380
Uh, do you mean we'll be going
with you, Your Excellency?

12:21.380 --> 12:24.130
Huh? I guess, if that's what you want.

12:24.130 --> 12:25.210
It's a date!

12:25.210 --> 12:26.330
A holiday date!

12:26.330 --> 12:27.540
A secret rendezvous!

12:27.540 --> 12:30.830
Lady Komari.
Aren't you taking this a little too far?

12:30.830 --> 12:32.330
Eh? What do you mean by-

12:32.330 --> 12:33.830
Whoa, it's a date!

12:33.830 --> 12:36.040
Since the terrorist is targeting
important government officials,

12:36.040 --> 12:38.920
we should kill those officials before they do!

12:38.920 --> 12:44.170
I'm gonna be the one to go on
that date with Her Excellency!

12:44.170 --> 12:47.630
They're the one's sounding
like terrorists now...

12:49.580 --> 12:50.580
Excuse us.

12:50.580 --> 12:51.290
You-

12:51.290 --> 12:52.960
You are giving the worst impression ever!

12:53.830 --> 12:55.330
Miss Terakomari?

12:55.330 --> 12:58.130
H-hey, Sakuna.
Sorry this is so sudden.

12:58.130 --> 13:01.000
I came here to have a meeting about
getting rid of the terrorist.

13:01.000 --> 13:03.080
Were you in the middle of something?

13:03.080 --> 13:06.210
Oh, not at all!
Absolutely no problem!

13:06.210 --> 13:09.000
I was just taking my leave!

13:09.000 --> 13:12.710
Well then, Miss Memoir,
I humbly ask for your cooperation.

13:12.710 --> 13:13.710
Bye.

13:15.330 --> 13:18.670
It is an honor to make your
acquaintance, Miss Gandesblood!

13:18.670 --> 13:20.830
By the bye, do you believe in God?

13:20.830 --> 13:23.670
Huh? Er, I suppose,
as much as anyone else does...

13:23.670 --> 13:26.290
Oh! My, how pious!

13:26.290 --> 13:30.170
Your great success is due to the fact
that you are a devout follower of God!

13:30.420 --> 13:33.880
I would love to have a full discussion
about creation and God's work

13:33.880 --> 13:36.290
the next time there's a chance!

13:36.290 --> 13:37.830
Well then...

13:39.710 --> 13:42.290
God bless you all!

13:44.130 --> 13:46.830
Sakuna, are you friends with that guy?

13:46.830 --> 13:50.540
He is Helldeus Heaven,
one of the Seven Crimson Lords.

13:50.540 --> 13:52.040
He's a Crimson Lord too?

13:52.040 --> 13:54.830
Yes, however he works as
a priest at his main job,

13:54.830 --> 13:58.250
and he operates a church and orphanage
on the outskirts of the imperial capital.

13:58.250 --> 14:00.960
Miss Memoir is also from that orphanage.

14:00.960 --> 14:02.500
I-I see.

14:04.210 --> 14:05.750
It's already noon?

14:06.420 --> 14:11.670
Um, if you don't mind, Sakuna,
do you want to eat lunch together?

14:12.960 --> 14:17.000
Yes, definitely, if you're okay
with that, Miss Terakomari.

14:17.580 --> 14:19.710
It's Her Excellency Miss Gandesblood.

14:19.710 --> 14:21.000
It's really her.

14:21.000 --> 14:23.460
She projects such an aura of carnage!

14:23.630 --> 14:27.080
Choosing this place
may have been a mistake...

14:27.080 --> 14:28.330
Um...

14:28.330 --> 14:30.790
Did you read my letter?

14:30.790 --> 14:33.710
Yup. I like reading too.

14:33.710 --> 14:36.000
I think you and I will get along great.

14:36.000 --> 14:38.250
Yeah. I'm glad.

14:38.580 --> 14:41.460
But more importantly, um...

14:41.460 --> 14:46.040
What do you think about
how I became a Crimson Lord?

14:46.040 --> 14:47.540
Let me see...

14:47.540 --> 14:50.830
Just so I know, how did you
overthrow the last one?

14:52.000 --> 14:54.830
When I was practicing magic,

14:54.830 --> 14:57.540
one of the Seven Crimson Lords
happened to be passing by,

14:57.540 --> 14:59.330
and they got hit and died.

14:59.330 --> 15:00.790
O-oh...

15:00.790 --> 15:05.210
Then, Mr. Helldeus recommended me
to the Seven Crimson Lords.

15:05.420 --> 15:07.420
He made a direct appeal to
Her Majesty the Empress,

15:07.420 --> 15:09.540
and somehow I was accepted.

15:09.540 --> 15:11.040
Oh, okay.

15:11.630 --> 15:15.710
But it's difficult to conceal
your true power, right?

15:15.710 --> 15:18.790
If a subordinate finds out
their superior is weak,

15:18.790 --> 15:20.830
they'll definitely be overthrown.

15:21.380 --> 15:23.880
I don't think that's true, though.

15:24.460 --> 15:29.000
All of my subordinates know
that I'm not so strong.

15:29.500 --> 15:35.080
But they support me so I can manage
being a Crimson Lord even as I am now.

15:35.790 --> 15:40.460
That's why I want to quit,
but even so, I have to do my best.

15:40.830 --> 15:42.710
Holy crap, I'm jealous.

15:42.710 --> 15:44.880
You're so impressive, Miss Terakomari.

15:44.880 --> 15:49.210
Unlike me, you seem to be having
success as a Crimson Lord,

15:49.210 --> 15:51.460
like it's your calling.

15:54.380 --> 15:55.790
Lady Komari.

15:55.790 --> 15:58.000
It's about time to start
that work meeting.

15:58.000 --> 16:00.630
Y-you're right, let's see...

16:00.630 --> 16:05.170
The culprit seems to possess a
Core Implosion that manipulates memories.

16:05.170 --> 16:08.500
Lady Memoir, do you know
about Core Implosion?

16:08.500 --> 16:10.880
Yes. At least the gossip about it.

16:11.000 --> 16:12.540
Core Implosion is an absolute ability

16:12.540 --> 16:15.460
beyond that of humans
which differs from magic.

16:15.460 --> 16:19.380
If the terrorist really has
a Core Implosion,

16:19.380 --> 16:21.960
there's no such thing
as being too careful.

16:22.330 --> 16:26.420
Um, I'm very weak, will that be okay?

16:26.420 --> 16:28.830
Don't worry about a thing.

16:28.830 --> 16:31.040
I'll protect you, Sakuna!

16:33.130 --> 16:34.920
Thank you so much.

16:34.920 --> 16:38.960
I'm only strong enough to
crush an apple in one hand.

16:38.960 --> 16:41.750
I need to at least be able to
smash a watermelon, right?

16:41.750 --> 16:45.170
I thought Sakuna was just like me...

16:45.170 --> 16:47.670
But we shouldn't waste food, you know.

16:47.670 --> 16:48.630
Right!

16:49.790 --> 16:52.630
Both the goal and the method
of this terrorist are unclear,

16:52.630 --> 16:54.830
but they frequently appear at night.

16:54.830 --> 16:57.460
Their actions are limited to
the the Mulnite Palace.

16:57.670 --> 17:01.630
In short, we should patrol
the palace during the night.

17:01.630 --> 17:03.670
Night patrol...

17:03.670 --> 17:06.170
So that means there's no work
during the day?

17:06.170 --> 17:08.130
And I can sleep in till noon?

17:08.130 --> 17:10.000
What are you talking about?

17:10.000 --> 17:12.290
Afternoon is afternoon.
Night is night.

17:12.670 --> 17:16.080
You have to work from about
9 in the morning until 8 at night.

17:16.080 --> 17:19.790
I'm not kidding! I absolutely do not
want to work that much!

17:19.790 --> 17:20.630
Lady Komari.

17:20.630 --> 17:21.460
What is it?

17:21.460 --> 17:23.710
You're drawing everyone's attention.

17:23.710 --> 17:26.330
Doesn't that disqualify her from
being a Crimson Lord?

17:26.330 --> 17:28.920
No, she may have just blurted that out...

17:28.920 --> 17:31.500
Wouldn't that be even worse?

17:32.630 --> 17:33.830
I'm not kidding!

17:33.830 --> 17:37.580
I don't want to work for
such a short amount of time!

17:37.580 --> 17:40.210
Even children are still awake at 8!

17:40.210 --> 17:45.210
How can we catch a cunning terrorist
without patrolling for even later?!

17:45.580 --> 17:47.170
Wow!
How wonderful!<b></b>

17:47.170 --> 17:52.580
Well then, let's patrol together
everyday at 10 pm starting tonight.

17:52.920 --> 17:54.830
Lady Memoir, you don't mind either, do you?

17:54.830 --> 17:56.000
It's fine with me!

17:56.000 --> 17:58.920
I also want to do my best to learn
by observing Miss Terakomari!

18:01.960 --> 18:03.250
Wh-what's that?

18:03.250 --> 18:04.040
What's going on?

18:04.040 --> 18:06.250
Could that be the terrorist?!

18:10.040 --> 18:11.880
Bellius! Caostel!

18:12.130 --> 18:13.880
Why are you guys are here too?

18:13.880 --> 18:16.710
My apologies, Your Excellency. It just...

18:17.380 --> 18:18.830
Hey, Bellius!

18:29.250 --> 18:31.130
Y-you've been revived?!

18:31.130 --> 18:32.670
That's amazing, Sakuna!

18:32.670 --> 18:33.960
You think so?

18:35.630 --> 18:37.540
Bellius, are you all right?

18:37.540 --> 18:39.130
Yes, I'll manage.

18:40.210 --> 18:43.750
Your Excellency! I'm very sorry!
It's Flöte Mascarail!

18:43.750 --> 18:45.790
She's the one that defeated us!

18:45.790 --> 18:46.630
What?

18:51.250 --> 18:52.630
Uh-huh.

18:52.630 --> 18:55.670
H-hey, Mellaconcey,
the heck are you doing?!

18:55.670 --> 18:57.540
Yeah!

18:57.880 --> 18:59.670
Flöte's pissed and outta control!

18:59.670 --> 19:01.500
Got them furious shakes,
gettin' more wrinkles!

19:01.500 --> 19:03.420
That Black Flash,
she serious on the rizzle,

19:03.420 --> 19:06.290
Gonna drag us all to Hell,
been hearin' that sizzle-sizzle!

19:07.290 --> 19:08.630
Just talk normally!

19:09.710 --> 19:12.000
That lady came and attacked us,
so we're fighting back.

19:12.000 --> 19:14.170
You can talk normally?!

19:14.170 --> 19:16.080
What a horrible false accusation.

19:16.380 --> 19:19.460
I only fulfilled my duties.

19:20.580 --> 19:21.920
F-Flöte!

19:21.920 --> 19:23.830
What the heck is going on?

19:23.830 --> 19:25.250
Depending on your response...

19:29.170 --> 19:33.080
Oh my, Lady Memoir is more
the type to react, then?

19:33.080 --> 19:37.830
U-um, I don't think it's a good idea
to just come and attack out of the blue.

19:40.380 --> 19:42.710
My hand just slipped a little, that's all.

19:42.710 --> 19:44.040
I'm sorry.

19:44.040 --> 19:48.080
If it were aimed at you, you could easily
defend against an attack like that, right?

19:48.080 --> 19:48.710
Huh?

19:48.710 --> 19:53.670
Uh, that's true, but you certainly
helped me out, Sakuna!

19:53.670 --> 19:54.710
Thanks!

19:55.540 --> 19:57.000
She praised me!

19:57.000 --> 19:59.130
She's so cute, what the heck...

20:00.040 --> 20:01.710
What are you doing?!

20:01.710 --> 20:04.540
I'm asking what you did to my subordinates!

20:07.710 --> 20:10.130
Destruction of property
and attempted murder.

20:10.880 --> 20:13.460
They're dying here, your subordinates!

20:13.460 --> 20:16.290
They were arrogantly
running around the palace!

20:16.290 --> 20:19.080
I put a stop to all that!

20:20.380 --> 20:23.710
Goodness, in addition to your
obscure capabilities,

20:23.710 --> 20:27.580
it's almost impossible for you to
effectively conduct your own troops!

20:27.580 --> 20:32.380
There has never been
a Crimson Lord like this before.

20:34.040 --> 20:35.500
I've made a decision.

20:35.500 --> 20:38.460
I will, at the Seven Crimson Lords conference,

20:38.460 --> 20:42.710
will submit a vote of no confidence
in Terakomari Gandesblood.

20:42.710 --> 20:43.540
Huh?

20:43.540 --> 20:47.290
I look forward to what decision
will be handed down.

21:01.630 --> 21:02.580
I understand.

21:03.130 --> 21:06.630
It seems she's finally eaten
the bloody buns I gave her.

21:06.630 --> 21:07.880
What's that have to do with anything?

21:08.380 --> 21:11.880
My Core Implosion "Pandora Poison"
is an unusual power

21:11.880 --> 21:14.880
where I can see the future of
whoever drinks my blood.

21:14.880 --> 21:16.040
Their future?

21:16.040 --> 21:20.710
When I gave them to Lady Mascarail,
they had my blood on them.

21:20.710 --> 21:23.040
So, wh-what's gonna happen?

21:23.040 --> 21:25.880
At the Seven Crimson Lords conference
venue to be held in three days,

21:25.880 --> 21:27.630
you will be denounced,

21:27.630 --> 21:30.830
and ultimately, majority rule by
the Crimson Lords will be taken.

21:30.830 --> 21:32.290
As a result...

21:32.290 --> 21:34.080
you will explode, Lady Komari.

21:35.920 --> 21:36.790
That's a joke, right?

21:36.790 --> 21:37.540
It's the truth.

21:37.540 --> 21:39.460
Please, tell me it's a joke!

21:39.460 --> 21:40.880
I-it'll be okay!

21:40.880 --> 21:44.500
If it's a majority vote,
I'll be on your side!

21:44.500 --> 21:45.540
Sakuna...

21:45.540 --> 21:48.540
You really are a good girl.

21:49.080 --> 21:51.750
Ah, I'm sorry, I wasn't thinking.
Did you hate that?

21:51.750 --> 21:54.130
I didn't dislike it. It was nice.

21:55.330 --> 21:57.380
It's like I have a big sister now.

21:58.710 --> 22:02.380
It's the same for me!
I'd love a little sister like you, Sakuna!

22:02.380 --> 22:03.920
R-really?

22:07.250 --> 22:08.710
Big Sis Komari.

22:12.830 --> 22:14.250
Call me that again!

22:14.250 --> 22:15.500
Big Sis Komari!

22:15.500 --> 22:18.040
Lady Komari, this is no time to be flirting.

22:18.500 --> 22:22.920
Even if you have the backing of Lady Memoir,
there are still five other Crimson Lords.

22:22.920 --> 22:26.630
Presumably, the greater portion of those five
will hold some sentiment against you.

22:27.420 --> 22:28.960
What should I do?

22:28.960 --> 22:30.750
I'll take care of this.

22:30.750 --> 22:32.170
O-okay.

22:32.830 --> 22:34.540
I'm a good girl, too.

22:34.540 --> 22:35.750
Y-yeah.

22:36.540 --> 22:37.750
Um...

22:37.750 --> 22:41.630
Miss Terakomari, you don't like
fighting very much, do you?

22:41.630 --> 22:43.710
Eh? Wh-wh-wh-why do you ask?

22:43.710 --> 22:46.330
I mean, I think a normal Crimson Lord

22:46.330 --> 22:49.880
would want to settle things
in a more violent manner.

22:49.880 --> 22:53.250
Like anyone going against
someone like Miss Flöte

22:53.250 --> 22:56.000
would quiet her with a show
of force or something.

22:56.000 --> 22:59.580
O-of course I think that would be
most effective way!

23:00.960 --> 23:04.420
However, I make it a rule not to
engage in pointless fights!

23:04.420 --> 23:08.330
If I can, I want to settle things
by talking it out.

23:08.960 --> 23:12.290
I see, that's what I thought you'd say!

23:58.380 --> 24:00.580
"A Roundtable of Lowlives."

23:58.540 --> 24:00.960
<b>A Roundtable of Lowlives</b>
